# Pairs with PeerAuthorityBounded. The elevated probe's failure reason reaches the
# peer, so its answer differs between a missing backup and one it may not restore.
MODULE: PeerRestoreProbeIsExistenceOracle
TARGET: PeerAuthorityBounded
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: an elevated prepare reports why the admission probe failed, telling a missing backup from a refused one
PERTURBS: Prepare

--- FIND
IF up THEN "peerRefusal" ELSE "probeFailed")
--- REPLACE
"probeFailed")
--- END
